# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# CoachMind — local environment template
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` (which is gitignored) and fill in the values
# from your Supabase project's API settings:  https://supabase.com/dashboard
#
# Without these set the app falls back to LOCAL-ONLY mode — Zustand + localStorage
# only. Auth, cloud sync, and multi-device features are disabled gracefully.
#
# Only the two NEXT_PUBLIC_* keys are read by the browser. They are safe to expose
# because Row-Level Security policies are the actual access control.
#
# NEVER commit a real `.env.local`. NEVER use the service-role key in this file.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Supabase project URL (Settings → API → Project URL)
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=

# Public anon key (Settings → API → Project API keys → anon / public)
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
